NanoGPT
Standard auto-routed text model API usage is billed at list prices with no markup (manually pinned providers add the applicable provider-selection markup, normally 5% with route-specific exceptions; BYOK requests are instead billed at 5% of the normal model cost, since you pay your own provider directly). No percentage deposit fees. Exact cost is returned on chat completion and Responses API responses.
Website: https://nano-gpt.com/
Pricing: https://nano-gpt.com/pricing
