All Batches List (OpenAI-compatible): https://api.nano-gpt.com/api/v1/batches
Anthropic Message Batches: POST/GET https://api.nano-gpt.com/v1/messages/batches (direct Anthropic batch pricing; official Anthropic SDK with base URL https://api.nano-gpt.com and a NanoGPT API key; details in llms-full.txt).
OpenAPI: https://nano-gpt.com/openapi.json
Support: https://nano-gpt.com/support
Feature requests: https://nano-gpt.com/feedback
API keys cannot submit feedback. POST /api/v1/feedback returns 410 feedback_submission_disabled; stop retries and use the website. Existing receipts remain readable through GET /api/v1/feedback/{id} with the original submitting key.
